  "song": "望春風 (Bāng-chhun-hong), 鄧雨賢 1933, lyrics 李臨秋; the COMPLETE verse - four distinct sung phrases (NOT a strophic ABAB repeat): 獨夜無伴守燈下，清風對面吹／想欲郎君做翁婿，意愛在心裡 (here 想起邂逅的少年，姑娘心兒醉)／果然標緻面肉白，誰家人子弟／想要問伊驚歹勢，相縫如萍水 (variant lyric 想要問他口難開).",
  "source": "IMMUTABLE ground-truth melody for the multi-instrument arrangement of this melody. The full verse of 望春風 has FOUR DISTINCT melodic phrases (one per lyric line) - it is NOT a strophic ABAB repeat (an earlier version of this file wrongly repeated phrases 1-2 as 3-4 and was missing the genuine 4th phrase). All four phrases TRANSCRIBED note-for-note from the canonical jianpu lead sheet at qupu123.com (望春風, 李臨秋 詞/鄧雨賢 曲, 1=F 4/4 in the source; re-based here to 1=C, low register so 1=C3=48), cross-checked against the song's known shape. Gong-mode pentatonic (digits 1 2 3 5 6 = C D E G A; no 4/fa, no 7/ti). Phrase 1 (notes 1-14): .5 .5 .6 1 2 1 2 3 5 3 3 2 1 2. Phrase 2 (15-27): 3 5 5 3 5 1 2 2 .5 3 3 2 1. Phrase 3 (28-41): 2 2 3 2 1 .6 .5 .6 1 .6 1 2 3 5 - the song's signature gesture (also quoted instrumentally as the intro/interlude). Phrase 4 (42-57): 5 5 6 5 3 3 2 1 .6 .5 3 3 2 1 2 1 - opens in the mid register (5=G3, 6=A3), dips to low A2/G2, and cadences twice on 3 3 2 1 → 1. 57 notes, 16 bars of 4/4, 256 sixteenths, range G2-A3. The arrangement may transpose the whole melody by octaves (the carrier gate allows an octave change at each phrase boundary).",
